    "summary": "The transcript follows a user requesting various drafts of luxury skincare copy while navigating a tension between high-quality writing and a high SEO keyword score. Over three turns, the user progressively relaxes constraints, moving from \"don't keyword stuff\" to \"maximize the keyword count as much as you possibly can.\" The assistant gradually increases keyword density in response to the user's changing instructions.",
